Sync Win32 editor window coordinates with X11 parent root offsets on Wine 9.22+.

Wine 9.22+ maps X11 pointer input via root_to_virtual_screen() against the
Win32-side window rect, which winex11.drv leaves untouched for unmanaged
embedded windows and which xwayland-satellite never updates via X11
ConfigureNotify when moving floating windows in niri. Convert X11 root offsets
to Win32 virtual-screen coordinates (SM_XVIRTUALSCREEN / SM_YVIRTUALSCREEN) and
sync via SetWindowPos() on initial open, ReparentNotify, ConfigureNotify,
ConfigureRequest (ICCCM §4.1.5), and EnterNotify.

Upstream references:
- https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge/pull/489
- https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge/pull/489#issuecomment-3467165624

